  "title": "Projectile Target Challenge: Pick Angle and Speed",
  "description": "A launcher sits at the left end of a flat 70 m field with marks every 10 m. A red target disc with a flag stands down the field. Set the launch angle (the barrel tilts) and speed, then press Launch: the ball flies its arc with a trail, and the previous arc stays as a faded ghost. Readouts give landing distance, miss distance and side, flight time and highest point. Hit targets at 30 m, 45 m and 18 m within 10 launches.",
